      "id": "claim_857d47f7e38c485fbc36518bb6b76a7a",
      "statement": "LocalCache persists its in-memory Map<String,String> as JSON to one self-contained file per cache and addresses entries by the key's content-derived localKey(), so identical content always maps to the same entry; all mutating and reading methods are synchronized.",
