      "id": "claim_8a0de6c887b645bb8cd28a6a50b5b91f",
      "statement": "UnifiedRedisClient is the public AutoCloseable seam between RedisCache and concrete Redis transports, exposing exactly ping, exists, hget, hset, and close; RedisAdapter delegates to a Jedis UnifiedJedis (ping succeeds only when the reply equals PONG) and RestRedisAdapter delegates to org.fuchss:rest-redis's Client, letting one Cache implementation serve both transports.",
